18
00:00:31,273 --> 00:00:32,826
Up there the wind blows the other

19
00:00:32,637 --> 00:00:35,119
way, and the Kuroshio current pushes toward

20
00:00:34,931 --> 00:00:35,693
America.

21
00:00:36,118 --> 00:00:38,084
He left Cebu on June 1st.

22
00:00:38,212 --> 00:00:40,649
Four months later, he reached Acapulco.

23
00:00:41,074 --> 00:00:43,545
That route, the tornaviaje, was sailed by

24
00:00:43,356 --> 00:00:46,171
